comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-07T05:48:29.648Z",codex-root,The contract boundary is read-only and typed. Generic ws call remains the forward-compatible escape hatch for new or custom frontend commands.
  "2026-08-07T05:59:07.189Z",codex-root,Implemented four typed read-only frontend commands with deterministic bounds and local validation. Shared WebSocket output handling removes the new transport duplication and preserves exact close behavior.
  "2026-08-07T06:05:16.852Z",codex-root,Self-review against the live response found frontend icon resources grouped by integration. The normalizer now recursively flattens nested icon maps into one deterministic semantic key/value row per icon; live typed output confirms three light service icons and a correctly bounded one-row slice.
