learnings[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-07T05:48:29.648Z",codex-root,"frontend/get_icons restricts category to conditions, entity, entity_component, services, or triggers; frontend/get_translations takes language and category plus optional integration list and config_flow."
  "2026-08-07T05:59:09.182Z",codex-root,Theme variables can exceed normal process output budgets; summary-first defaults plus explicit include-values avoid accidental unbounded agent context while retaining intentional full access.
