body: "Implement the current official read-only frontend WebSocket schemas without dynamic imports, any, or one-use wrapper helpers. Normalize nested resources into stable rows where useful, preserve raw values only when explicitly requested, apply deterministic sorting and positive bounds, and verify all advertised output formats against the live instance."
